Description: Essential Desktop Environment and Quality-of-Life Tools
This metapackage streamlines the setup of a user-friendly Ubuntu desktop. It focuses on stability, multimedia support, and daily productivity.
.
Included are industry-standard tools for communication (Zoom, Discord), document management (Calibre, LibreOffice), and system essentials (fscrypt). Designed to be "production-ready" for non-technical users while maintaining the robustness required for a professional workstation.
